type(scope): subject

# ------------------------------
# TYPES
# ------------------------------
# feat     → New feature
# fix      → Bug fix
# refactor → Code change (no feature or bug fix)
# test     → Adding or updating tests
# chore    → Maintenance / tooling / dependencies
# docs     → Documentation changes

# ------------------------------
# FORMAT
# ------------------------------
# type(scope): short summary (max 72 characters)
#
# Optional body:
# - Explain WHY the change was made
# - Explain important implementation details
# - Mention side effects if any
#
# Optional footer:
# - Closes #123
# - BREAKING CHANGE: explanation
#
# ------------------------------
# EXAMPLE
# ------------------------------
# feat(auth): add sanctum token authentication
#
# Implemented token-based authentication using Laravel Sanctum.
# Added middleware protection for API routes.
#
# Closes #12
